# Gemini batch model checks and weekly summaries (scripts/gemini-batch.sh).
#
# WHY: the repository allowlist, the public-visibility rule, the pinned model
# ids, which pull requests may be sent to the provider, the monthly call, token,
# request and cost caps, and the secret patterns that refuse an input all used
# to be shell literals. Keeping them as data here lets the batch script, its
# tests and a reviewer read one rule order. Default deny, forbid wins.

